    "body": "No plan to upgrade to a newer GTK version.\r\nThe [graphics library](https://wiki.lazarus.freepascal.org/Roadmap) I used does not support GTK3 or GTK4.\r\n\r\nGTK3 is also not present in the [current minimum supported list](https://forum.lazarus.freepascal.org/index.php/topic,65612.0.html?PHPSESSID=cjth32qlbm1q65bln4bp9stu14).\r\n**FreeBSD/Linux:**\r\n  gtk 2.24 for gtk2, qt4.5 for qt, qt5.6 for qt5, Qt6.2 for qt6, 32 or 64bit.\r\n\r\nIn the future I will add qt5 and qt6 release build for users who don't use 'Snapcraft' or 'Flathub'",
